* lna-a1-inddegen-cascode: inductively-degenerated cascode CS LNA.
* Lineage: Shaeffer & Lee, "A 1.5-V, 1.5-GHz CMOS Low Noise Amplifier",
* JSSC 1997. Bench-v1 anchor; verbatim of the proven v0.2 external c1
* (round-1 external, wl dcda50191d7c5e73, 10/24 gf180 topology credit).
* Structure-only, ZERO component values. Published BIAS NETWORK in-topology:
* current-mirror reference (R1 -> diode NM3) feeds the input gate through R2;
* input DC-blocked (C1); cascode gate at VDD (AC ground).
* Approved 2026-09-14 (bench round 1, "approve all").
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n3 VSS
L L2 n3 VSS
NMOS NM2 n4 VDD n2 VSS
L L3 VDD n4
C C2 n4 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1
